  <p id="c-jinshu-076-jin076-guzhong-parent:head" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-076-jin076-guzhong-parent:head:m0000" ref="jfc_0dt_42a_A">顧衆</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-076-jin076-guzhong-parent:head:m0004" ref="jfc_0dt_42a_A">長始</persName>，吳郡吳人，驃騎將軍<persName id="c-jinshu-076-jin076-guzhong-parent:head:m0016" ref="wtz_smr_dwz">榮</persName>之族弟也。父<persName id="c-jinshu-076-jin076-guzhong-parent:head:m0023" ref="jfc_0dt_42a">秘</persName>，交州刺史，有文武才幹。</p>
